codex
The Mercan Yucel source has a clean table for black pepper, cumin, and red pepper with n=20 per spice. It reports total arsenic only in cumin; it does not report inorganic arsenic, so routing has to stay at `tAs`.
codex
The Alam spice preprint is already represented in `wishlist-fetch-audit.csv` as both the preprint download and the later published Biological Trace Element Research DOI candidate, but there is no wiki source page yet. I’ll ingest the PDF we actually have under the preprint DOI and note the later DOI candidate in verification rather than silently substituting it.
codex
